        },
        {
          "text": "Mba aziri ma o’du alusi kuhani Ezira nga buku azitaniri eji ’ba ongulumuru ma milia, agupi pi oku pie, ’ba dria ecopi e’yo eripi e’yo vaza be ’diyi pie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eri nga e’yo ovupi aleniari la, irii Kalitile Yiari ma driliaria, engazu o’bitisi cazu etu agaa birri, agupi pi ma drilia okuyi pie, ’ba dria ecopi e’yo vapi ’diyi pie; ’ba dria co yi ma bile buku azi­taniri erizu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Te Ezira ’ba waraga sipiri so pa pari e’yo oluzu edele patisi, ’bani edele pila azi ’ dirisiri ma dria; ’ba eri ma ageia ’diyi yi ’di: Matitia pi, Sema pie, Anaya pie, Uria pie, Hilikia pie, Maaseya pie, yi so pa eri ma dri ndiria; pa sopi eri ma dri ejia ’diyi yi ’di: Pedaya pi, Misaeli pie, Malikiya pie, Hasumu pie, Hasibadani pie, Zekaria pie, Mesulamu pie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
