                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Te Yesua pi nga yi dri e’yo ece yini vazu, Bani pie, Serebia pie, Yamini pie, Akubu pie’i Sabetai pie, Hodia pie, Maaseya pie, Kelita pie, Azaria pie, Yozabadi pie, Hanani pie, Pelaya pie, ’ba Levini ’diyi pie; ’ba ongulumuru nga pa so yi ma paria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.7"
            ]
          }
